{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主呼召以賽亞作先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["當烏西雅王崩的那年，我見主坐在高高的寶座上。他的衣裳垂下，遮滿聖殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["其上有撒拉弗侍立，各有六個翅膀：用兩個翅膀遮臉，兩個翅膀遮腳，兩個翅膀飛翔；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["彼此呼喊說：",{"text":"聖哉！聖哉！聖哉！萬軍之耶和華；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的榮光充滿全地！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因呼喊者的聲音，門檻的根基震動，殿充滿了煙雲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那時我說：「禍哉！我滅亡了！因為我是嘴唇不潔的人，又住在嘴唇不潔的民中，又因我眼見大君王－萬軍之耶和華。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["有一撒拉弗飛到我跟前，手裏拿着紅炭，是用火剪從壇上取下來的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["將炭沾我的口，說：「看哪，這炭沾了你的嘴，你的罪孽便除掉，你的罪惡就赦免了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我又聽見主的聲音說：「我可以差遣誰呢？誰肯為我們去呢？」我說：「我在這裏，請差遣我！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他說：「你去告訴這百姓說：",{"text":"你們聽是要聽見，卻不明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看是要看見，卻不曉得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使這百姓心蒙脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵發沉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼睛昏迷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怕眼睛看見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵聽見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心裏明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回轉過來，便得醫治。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我就說：「主啊，這到幾時為止呢？」他說：",{"text":"直到城邑荒涼，無人居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房屋空閒無人，地土極其荒涼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且耶和華將人遷到遠方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在這境內撇下的地土很多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境內剩下的人若還有十分之一，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必被吞滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像栗樹、橡樹雖被砍伐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樹墩子卻仍存留。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這聖潔的種類在國中也是如此。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}